{"3":[{"k":"p","t":"GAME PLAY"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Destroy the assaulting enemy tanks by maneuvering your tank (with the control stick) and firing your tank cannon (with the fire button). Score is accumulated by destroying enemy tanks."},{"k":"li","t":"2. Your tank can move and fire in eight directions but tne enemy tanks can move and fire in only four directions. Your tank can move and fire diagonally."},{"k":"li","t":"3. Each time an assaulting enemy tank is destroyed, a reserve tank located at the top of the screen is alerted (flickers) and joins the remaining assaulting tanks."},{"k":"li","t":"4. By dodging assaulting tank fire, you can penetrate the reserve tank positions and destroy them accumulating a higher score."},{"k":"li","t":"5. As the number of reserve tanks decreases either by joining the assaulting tanks or by being destroyed, the speed of the remaining assaulting tanks increases."},{"k":"li","t":"6. Your score progressively increases as the number of screens cleared increases. When you destroy a reserve tank, you are awarded a score twice as high as that awarded when you hit an assaulting tank."},{"k":"p","t":"Number of Screens Cleared Assaulting Tank Reserve Tank"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   100 Pts.   200 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"2   150 Pts.   300 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"3   200 Pts.   400 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"4   250 Pts.   500 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"5   300 Pts.   600 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"6   350 Pts.   700 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"7   400 Pts.   800 Pts."},{"k":"tr","t":"8   450 Pts.   900 Pts."},{"k":"li","t":"7. Dependent on the option switch setting, an extra tank can be awarded after accumulating a set amount of points."}],"6":[{"k":"p","t":"A, POSITIONS OF DIP SWITCHES"},{"k":"p","t":"OFF sw Lon Dip switches"},{"k":"li","t":"- + BOEBEHRe MAIN CIRCUIT BOARD"},{"k":"p","t":"SW.7 and SW.8 not used"},{"k":"h","t":"B. SETTING THE OPTION (DIP SWITCHES)"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Change-over setting of the mode of game Fig. 1 Positions of Dip Switches"},{"k":"li","t":